## Shared machine (paste into a project's CLAUDE.md)
- Run every heavy job through the lanes: builds, tests and exporters with `with_cpu.sh <session> <cmd>`, game, engine,
  Blender and AI-model runs with `with_gpu.sh <session> <cmd>`. Use your session's title as <session>.
- Anything that runs the game or writes a shared build output also takes the project lock, lock first:
  `with_gpu.sh <session> tools/with_lock.sh <session> <cmd>`.
- Never pass a script on stdin (`python - <<EOF`); write a file. Exit 75 = no slot within 90 minutes (nothing ran),
  76 = the game guard closed the job (it took the foreground), 77 = less than 2 GB free on the drive.
- Background runs only: never take the mouse, keyboard or focus.
